{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2022-10-26 11:10:00', 'title': 'NICOR GAS AND SOUTHERN COMPANY PARTNER WITH TWO LOCAL HABITAT FOR HUMANITY AFFILIATES TO BUILD ENERGY EFFICIENT, NET ZERO COMMUNITIES IN CHICAGOLAND', 'text': 'SMART NEIGHBORHOOD™\xa0CONCEPTS BEING PLANNED FOR AURORA AND NORTHERN FOX VALLEY NAPERVILLE, ILL. , OCT. 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY, NICOR GAS AND SOUTHERN COMPANY ARE ANNOUNCING A NEW PARTNERSHIP WITH THE FOX\xa0VALLEY AND NORTHERN FOX VALLEY HABITAT FOR HUMANITY AFFILIATES TO DEVELOP SMART NEIGHBORHOOD™ COMMUNITIES DEDICATED TO PROVIDING AFFORDABLE, NET ZERO GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS HOUSING OPTIONS IN THE CHICAGOLAND AREA.'}